OL,4,CPension and benefits services still    
OL,5,Coffline after 'cyber incident' hits DWP
OL,6,FRegular benefit and pension payments   
OL,7,Fare not affected and will be paid as   
OL,8,Fnormal, the department says.           
OL,10,FGemma, 34, says she has just #30 left  
OL,11,Fin her bank account and worries her    
OL,12,Fpayments could be cut if she fails to  
OL,13,Ffill out her universal credit journal  
OL,14,F- but DWP confirms people in           
OL,15,Fsituations like hers will not be       
OL,16,Fsanctioned.                            
OL,18,FOur correspondent says has become a    
OL,19,Fcatch-all term used in the early       
OL,20,Fstages of what often ends up being a - 
OL,21,Fhere's the difference.                 
