OL,7,GOutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA       
OL,8,Fbrighter day on Sunday, with blustery  
OL,9,Fshowers towards the northwest. Wet and 
OL,10,Fwindy weather is likely to sweep       
OL,11,Facross the UK through Monday and       
OL,12,FTuesday. Turning milder for all.       
