OL,4,C'I wouldn't be here today without      
OL,5,Cyou': Student's praise for man who     
OL,6,Cstopped train attacker                 
OL,7,GA student who survived the Huntingdon  
OL,8,Gtrain attack has met for the first     
OL,9,Gtime with the passenger she believes   
OL,10,Gsaved her life during the stabbings.   
OL,12,FAstrid told BBC News that Stephen      
OL,13,FCrean's decision to confront Anthony   
OL,14,FWilliams gave her time to escape. "I   
OL,15,Fowe him my life," she said.            
OL,17,FWilliams was found guilty on Thursday  
OL,18,Fof attempting to murder Crean and 13   
OL,19,Fothers.                                
