OL,4,CEx-council leader jailed for fraud and 
OL,5,Ctax evasion                            
OL,6,GA former council leader accused of     
OL,7,Ginventing a fake heritage society to   
OL,8,Gscam a local authority out of          
OL,9,Gthousands of pounds has been jailed    
OL,10,Gfor 27 months.                         
OL,12,FJason Zadrozny set up the Ashfield     
OL,13,FHeritage Society before applying for   
OL,14,Fcouncil funding, which he then         
OL,15,Ftransferred into his personal account. 
OL,17,FHe claimed the cash was "to support    
OL,18,Fheritage projects", but pocketed the   
OL,19,Fmoney for himself. He was convicted of 
OL,20,Ffraud and tax evasion on 21 September  
OL,21,Ffollowing a trial.                     
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
